  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Cat House.png|200px|left|Cat house]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Animal Shelters|Animal Shelter]]\n |level = 21 • 29\n |price = 500\n |houses = {{Infoicon|tabbyc|big|link=Tabby Cat}}{{Infoicon|calicoc|big|link=Calico Cat}}{{Infoicon|tuxedoc|big|link=Tuxedo Cat}} x3\n}}\n'''Cat houses''' are shelters for [[:Category:Cats|cats]]. The first house is unlocked at [[experience]] level 21.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Appearance'''===\nThe house is a wooden brown cat house on an elevated platform. However, cats never go into the house. They eat and sleep in front of it.\n----\n==='''Building'''===\nEach house costs 500 {{Infoicon|coin}} and can hold up to three cats. The second house is unlocked at level 29. Building them takes no time.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Katzenhütte\n|es = Caseta de gato\n|fr = Abri pour chats\n|no = Kattehus\n}}\n[[Category:Animal Shelters]]",
